  <descriptions>
    <description descriptionType="Abstract">This dataset collects data on the dimensions of the manuscripts and scripts of twelfth-century logical commentaries. It contains measures of the manuscripts, scripts and internal ratios of twelfth-century logical commentaries (file A); of a group of twelfth-century manuscripts containing logical authoritative works, two of which preserve glosses from the same period (file B). This dataset forms part of a broader analysis of the scripts of twelfth-century manuscripts transmitting logical commentaries.</description>
